  _modifiedFrom: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09139a28a32076e4598469dbe0a70a32, type: 2}
  _description: 'Effect: Nikita distributes Afterimage''s +25% Dodge bonus between
    herself and an ally within 2 tiles. Both receive +12.5% Dodge until Nikita''s
    next turn. The Energy recovery effect from successful dodges is removed.


    Explanation:
    Changes Afterimage from a personal defensive ability into a team-oriented defensive
    tool. Useful when paired with fragile teammates or against bosses that frequently
    target multiple party members. '
